cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If AWC UI supports your work, please cite the project using this metadata."
title: "AWC UI: Accessible Material Design 3 Web Components"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "AWC UI contributors"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Material Design 3 component library built with Stencil and
  standard Web Components, with typed React, Angular, Vue, and Svelte
  integrations, server-side rendering, design tokens, accessibility, RTL, and
  theming support for Next.js, Angular SSR, Nuxt, and SvelteKit.
repository-code: "https://github.com/awc-ui/core"
url: "https://awc-ui.dev"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Material Design 3
  - Web Components
  - custom elements
  - component library
  - design system
  - accessibility
  - React
  - Angular
  - Vue
  - Svelte
  - server-side rendering
  - Next.js SSR
  - Angular SSR
  - Nuxt SSR
  - SvelteKit SSR
